  "content": {
    "title": "Recall adds these Trader Joe's fan-favorite frozen foods",
    "text": "Trader Joe’s has expanded a recall on frozen fried rice after multiple customers reported finding glass in their food. (See the list below.) The sprawling expansion, initiated by Ajinomoto Foods North America, adds nearly 10 million pounds of product to the 3.3 million pounds of chicken fried rice already recalled in February due to customers reporting \"glass varying in size from 1-3cm long and 2-4mm wide\" in their food. ALSO READ: Another Texas city runs low on water, blames Corpus Christi Officially, Ajinomoto has recalled 9,885,240 pounds of product across multiple brands, a March 20 enforcement report from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, or FDA, says. The products have been distributed to Trader Joe's locations across 43 states, including within Texas. In a March 3 statement from Trader Joe's, store officials state they are recalling four products from store shelves, including the brand's Chicken Fried Rice, Vegetable Fried Rice, Japanese Style Fried Rice and Chicken Shu Mai. ALSO READ: Texas Hill Country wine exec arrested on DWI, weapon charges \"To Our Valued Customers, Related to the Ajinomoto recall initiated on February 19, 2026, in an abundance of caution, we are recalling certain Trader Joe’s frozen products because of the potential that they may be contaminated with foreign material — specifically, glass.\" The FDA identified the recall as a Class II in the enforcement report, which means the affected product \"may cause temporary or medically reversible adverse health consequences\" if consumed.  ALSO READ: Wembanyama following in footsteps of Herculean David Robinson The products Here's what to keep an eye out for on grocery store shelves, and what to trash in your freezer, according to Trader Joe's: Chicken Fried Rice: Best By Dates 03/04/2026 through 02/10/2027 Vegetable Fried Rice: Best By Dates 02/28/2026 through 11/19/2026 Japanese Style Fried Rice: Best By Dates 02/28/2026 through 11/14/2026 Chicken Shu Mai: Best By Dates 03/13/2026 through 10/23/2026",
    "word_count": 313,
